# HARD.P0-10 — H9: module path decision

## Decision (user, 2026-09-02)

Rename the module path to the real owner: `github.com/alternayte/restitch-gateway`
(chosen over keeping github.com/restitch/restitch-gateway, which 404s because
the remote is alternayte/restitch).

## Changes

- go.mod: module github.com/alternayte/restitch-gateway
- All 44 Go files with imports of the old path renamed mechanically
  (sed across *.go and go.mod), no semantic edits.
- CLAUDE.md module line updated (also corrects the stale Go 1.25.6 -> 1.25.7
  drift, finding L33).
- No replace directive: this is a single mechanical commit with zero
  remaining references to the old path inside the module, so a self-replace
  would be dead weight. The replace pattern is for consumers during a
  transition; see "Outstanding user action" below.

