## Outstanding user action (account-level, cannot be done from this repo)

The GitHub repository currently lives at github.com/alternayte/restitch.git.
`go get github.com/alternayte/restitch-gateway` resolves only after the repo
is reachable at that name. Rename the repo (gh repo rename restitch-gateway)
or create the matching repo, then push. Until then the remote 404s; the code
side of H9 is complete.
